section1.content2:
Skyfi.vn has a mechanism for customers to read and express their separate agreement with the general transaction terms before sending a payment contract proposal.

The general transaction terms include:

Return policy, including return period, method of returning or exchanging purchased goods, how to get money back, costs for returns (Published publicly on the website);

Product warranty policy (Published publicly on the website);

Service standards, service provision processes, fee schedules, and other terms related to service provision, including conditions and limitations (if any) (Published publicly on the website);

Obligations of the seller and obligations of the customer in each transaction (Published publicly on the website);
